# CoreOS runs on Claude. Set your Anthropic API key to enable live answers.
# Keys: https://console.anthropic.com  (pay-as-you-go; there is no free tier)
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, or set the variable in
# your hosting provider's environment settings.
#
# Without a key the app still runs — every agent returns a clearly-labelled
# message saying no key is configured, instead of a real answer.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
